[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12700100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12700100_02_0001","text":"摄影师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12700100_02_0010","text":"羽那，动一动试试吧！\n还有，表情也可以换一换哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12700100_02_0020","text":"啊，好的……！\n对不起～……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12700100_02_0030","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12700100_02_0040","text":"（拍照──\n　看来不太擅长啊）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12700100_02_0050","text":"（不过，毕竟是第一次嘛\n　多积累经验，慢慢习惯了就好──）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12700100_02_0060","text":"……嗯\n我先检查一下，稍等一下哦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12700100_02_0070","text":"好──\n谢谢您……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12700100_02_0080","text":"Pro、du、cer……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12700100_02_0090","text":"哈哈……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12700100_02_0100","text":"（羽那……\n　看起来玩得挺开心的，那就好……！）"}]
